s in combined school- and work-based post-secondary VET (CSV)</dct:title><dcat:accessURL rdf:resource="https://apprentix.eu/pages/indicators/eurostat-educ_uoe_enrs07-ed4sw.html"/><dcat:downloadURL rdf:resource="https://apprentix.eu/data/published/indicators/eurostat-educ_uoe_enrs07-ed4sw.csv"/><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/csv"/><dct:license rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/licence/CC_BY_4_0"/></dcat:Distribution></dcat:distribution><dcat:distribution><dcat:Distribution rdf:about="https://apprentix.eu/pages/indicators/eurostat-educ_uoe_enrs07-ed4sw.html#json"><dct:title>Pupils in combined school- and work-based post-secondary VET (JSON with provenance)</dct:title><dcat:accessURL rdf:resource="https://apprentix.eu/pages/indicators/eurostat-educ_uoe_enrs07-ed4sw.html"/><dcat:downloadURL rdf:resource="https://apprentix.eu/data/published/indicators/eurostat-educ_uoe_enrs07-ed4sw.json"/><dct:format rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"/><dcat:mediaType rdf:resource="https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/json"/><dct:license rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/licence/CC_BY_4_0"/></dcat:Distribution></dcat:distribution></dcat:Dataset></dcat:dataset>
  <dcat:dataset><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="https://apprentix.eu/pages/indicators/eurostat-tps00215.html#dataset"><dct:identifier>https://apprentix.eu/pages/indicators/eurostat-tps00215.html#dataset</dct:identifier><dct:title xml:lang="en">Recent VET graduates who had work-based learning</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">Share of 20–34-year-olds who completed a vocational upper-secondary or post-secondary qualification (ISCED 35/45) in the last three years and had at least one month of work-based learning during that programme. What is counted: From the EU Labour Force Survey. Several countries carry low-reliability flags (u); check flags before ranking.</dct:description><dcat:landingPage rdf:resource="https://apprentix.eu/pages/indicators/eurostat-tps00215.html"/><dct:publisher rdf:resource="https://apprentix.eu/#apprentix"/><dct:creator><foaf:Agent><foaf:name>Eurostat</foaf:name></foaf:Agent></dct:creator><dct:source rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tps00215/default/table?lang=en"/><dcat:theme rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"/><dct:language rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"/><dcat:contactPoint rdf:resource="https://apprentix.eu/#contact"/><dcat:keyword>apprenticeship</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword>vocational education and training</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword>VET</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword>work-based learning</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword>Europe</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword>Work-based learning</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword>tps00215</dcat:keyword><dct:spatial rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/><dct:spatial rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/><dct:spatial rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BIH"/><dct:spatial rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CHE"/><dct:spatial rdf:resource="http://publications.europa